I am sitting in the doctor's room.
The doctor looks at me and asks.
"Tell me, madam, what is the problem?"
I say, "Doctor, my health is not fine at all today."
"I am not feeling good since morning."
I point towards my head.
"I have a severe headache."
"My nose is completely blocked."
I also put a hand on my throat.
"And I also have a lot of pain in my throat."
The doctor listens to me carefully.
He asks, "Do you also have a fever?"
I answer, "Yes, maybe I have a mild fever."
"There is also pain in my whole body."
The doctor checks my throat with a small light.
He asks, "Does it hurt here?"
I say softly, "Yes, it hurts a lot."
The doctor says, "Do not worry, you have a bad cold."
"This is because of the rain and changing weather."
He begins writing my medicines.
